    {
      "id": "3ebc8fd8fe2eea34f6c0af087a988ae1633efb1d",
      "short_id": "3ebc8fd8",
      "created_at": "2021-09-13T05:09:01.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "2d08611d54ecb0c8e0199f304affbab11990cfac"
      ],
      "title": "dumpcap:Send SP_FILE after SHB passthru in child mode",
      "message": "dumpcap:Send SP_FILE after SHB passthru in child mode\n\nWhen dumpcap is running as a capture child in passthrough mode, the\nSP_FILE message should not be sent until after the source SHB is passed\nthrough to the capture file. Fixes a race condition where the capture\nparent attempts to read an SHB from the capture file, following the\nSP_FILE message, but the file is empty.  Closes #17013.\n",
      "author_name": "James Ko",
      "author_email": "jck@exegin.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-09-09T15:53:27.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2021-09-13T05:09:01.000+00:00",
